Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> programa
Rule 1     programa -> instrucao
Rule 2     programa -> programa instrucao
Rule 3     instrucao -> let_statement SEMICOLON
Rule 4     instrucao -> fun_statement SEMICOLON
Rule 5     instrucao -> expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 6     let_statement -> LET ID COLON tipo ASSIGN expressao
Rule 7     let_statement -> LET ID ASSIGN expressao
Rule 8     let_statement -> LET ID ID ASSIGN expressao
Rule 9     fun_statement -> FUN ID COLON tipo ARROW tipo
Rule 10    expressao -> WHEN LPAREN expressao RPAREN IS cases END
Rule 11    cases -> case
Rule 12    cases -> cases case
Rule 13    case -> pattern_list ARROW expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 14    case -> UNDERSCORE ARROW expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 15    pattern_list -> pattern
Rule 16    pattern_list -> pattern_list COMMA pattern
Rule 17    pattern -> INT
Rule 18    pattern -> FLOAT
Rule 19    pattern -> SUBTRACTION INT
Rule 20    pattern -> SUBTRACTION FLOAT
Rule 21    pattern -> TRUE
Rule 22    pattern -> FALSE
Rule 23    pattern -> ID
Rule 24    expressao -> expressao SUM expressao
Rule 25    expressao -> expressao SUBTRACTION expressao
Rule 26    expressao -> expressao PRODUCT expressao
Rule 27    expressao -> expressao BAR expressao
Rule 28    expressao -> expressao EQUAL expressao
Rule 29    expressao -> expressao LESS expressao
Rule 30    expressao -> expressao GREATER expressao
Rule 31    expressao -> IF expressao THEN expressao ELSE expressao
Rule 32    expressao -> LPAREN expressao RPAREN
Rule 33    expressao -> INT
Rule 34    expressao -> FLOAT
Rule 35    expressao -> TRUE
Rule 36    expressao -> FALSE
Rule 37    expressao -> ID LPAREN expressao RPAREN
Rule 38    expressao -> ID
Rule 39    tipo -> T_INT
Rule 40    tipo -> T_FLOAT
Rule 41    tipo -> T_BOOL
Rule 42    expressao -> SUBTRACTION expressao

